# Unsplash background search. Create .env.local (already git-ignored) with your own key.
#
# The Access Key from https://unsplash.com/oauth/applications — the "Access Key", not the
# "Secret Key". Unsplash's public Client-ID auth is designed to be used from a client, so
# this key ships inside the app bundle; it is not a password, but it still does not belong
# in the repository.
#
# Without it the app keeps the bundled background presets and the search section explains
# what is missing.
EXPO_PUBLIC_UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=
